---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import ImagePlaceholder from '../components/ImagePlaceholder.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="The SEO career, the ventures built and broken, and what I'm focused on now.">
  <section class="wrapper page-header">
    <div class="page-header__text prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>The real story, not the highlight reel.</h1>
    </div>
    <ImagePlaceholder class="page-header__portrait" ratio="4 / 5" label="Portrait photo" />
  </section>

  <section class="wrapper prose">
    <h2>The SEO career</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Placeholder — how the career actually started, the early wins, the years spent learning the
      hard way. Name the companies and campaigns that matter. State the specific mechanics that
      worked, not just the outcome.
    </p>

    <h2>Ventures built</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Placeholder — a plain list of the ventures, in order, each with a one-line verdict. Link out
      to the relevant <a href="/work">case studies</a> where there's a deeper write-up.
    </p>

    <h2>What failed, and why</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Placeholder — the ventures that didn't work, stated as plainly as the ones that did. What
      broke, what I misjudged, what I'd do differently. This section should read like an
      after-action report, not an apology.
    </p>

    <h2>Current focus</h2>
    <p class="text-muted">
      Placeholder — what I'm actually spending my time on right now. Keep this in sync with
      <a href="/now">/now</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 12rem;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    align-items: end;
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page-header__text {
    max-width: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .page-header {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .page-header__portrait {
      max-width: 12rem;
    }
  }

  section.prose {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  section.prose h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  section.prose h2:first-of-type {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
